<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Kleinwort cuts Kingfisher.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kleinwort cuts Kingfisher.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Kleinwort Benson reduced its rating on British retailer Kingfisher Plc to &quot;sell&quot; from &quot;hold,&quot; market sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The brokerage also raised its recommendation on retailer House of Fraser Plc to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot;, they said.</p>
<p>Details were not available.</p>
<p>Shares in Kingfisher were down 1-1/2p to 715-1/2 at 115 GMT, while shares in House of Fraser were up 1/2p to 170.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
